One should  reflect: while living here, my mindfulness becomes established, my mind becomes immersed in samādhi, their defilements come to an end, and they arrive at the supreme sanctuary. no progress and requisites are scarce = depart;
 No progress and requisites are plentiful = depart;
 Progress and requisites are scarce = stay;
 Progress and requisites are plentiful = stay.

