The world is, or is not eternal, finite or infinite; the soul and the body are the same thing, or different things; a realized one exists, doesn't exist, both exist, neither exists after death;
The realized one has done away with convictions.For The realized one has seen: ‘such is form, feelings, perceptions, fabrications and consciousness, such is their origin and such is their ending
